      "text": "$60^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NffTv",
      "text": "$80^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TFxra",
      "text": "$70^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Heat loss $=$ Heat gain $=\\mathrm{mS} \\Delta \\theta$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{So}, \\mathrm{m}_{\\mathrm{A}} \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{A}} \\Delta \\theta_{\\mathrm{A}}=\\mathrm{m}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\Delta \\theta_{\\mathrm{B}}$\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow 100 \\times \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{A}} \\times(100-90)=50 \\times \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\times(90-75) \\\\\r\n\r\n2 \\mathrm{~S}_{\\mathrm{A}}=1.5 \\mathrm{~S}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{A}}=\\frac{3}{4} \\mathrm{~S}_{\\mathrm{B}}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$\r\n\r\nNow, $100 \\times \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{A}} \\times(100-\\theta)=50 \\times \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\times(\\theta-50)$\r\n\r\n$2 \\times\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right) \\times(100-\\theta)=(\\theta-50)$\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n300-3 \\theta=2 \\theta-100 \\\\\r\n\r\n400=5 \\theta \\Rightarrow \\theta=80^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$",
    "image": null
  },
